  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I have this paralyzing fear that I'll maybe go nowhere",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But God forbid me ever admitting I could be scared",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I can't stand my friends right now, we got nothing in common",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But being lonely's worse than just having friends that don't care",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You said it looks like I've been going through hell",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "How did you know? How could you tell?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Ask me to explain myself, well",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm trying my best here to be brutally honest",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Nobody said changing would be this exhausting",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "A foot on the brake 'cause it's been making me carsick",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "How could you blame me? Growing up is chaotic",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Don't wanna say it but I really think that I miss him",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It might seem stupid but I still look through all of our texts",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Who knew that wanting someone could ever make me this desperate",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Don't think I'll do that again, no",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
